
-- R15 AVATAR CHANGER
-- Local visual overlay, using the player's original rig for movement.
--
-- Fixes attempted:
-- 1. Stop animations and neutralize Motor6D transforms before welding.
-- 2. Temporarily anchor the player root during setup.
-- 3. Keep all player Motor6Ds intact.
-- 4. Keep overlay Motor6Ds as instances, disable them after welding.
-- 5. Create all body welds before disabling overlay collision.
-- 6. Apply body proportions to the driver rig.
-- 7. Play target avatar animations directly on the player's Animator.
--
-- This is client-side visual customization. It does not change the
-- avatar other players see unless the game separately supports it.

